1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:13,000
A test suggestion is posted in the real Twitch chat for tem1rrllan. This channel is offline; no public stream is running.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Twitch EventSub delivers the message to Quest Director. The local AI checks it against the PUBG stream profile and puts it in the approval queue.

3
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:36,000
After streamer approval, the challenge appears in the OBS overlay. Chat cannot put a mission on screen by itself.

4
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:48,000
The streamer marks the test mission as not completed. Game outcomes are not automatically verified in this prototype.
